static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0530629Z     	log level for reviewdog itself. (debug, info, warning, error) (default "info")
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0531081Z   -name string
