static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0532717Z     		"local" (default)
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0533075Z     			Report results to stdout.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0533451Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0533730Z     		"rdjson"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0534071Z     			Report results to stdout in rdjson format.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0534439Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0534741Z     		"rdjsonl"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0535098Z     			Report results to stdout in rdjsonl format.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0535451Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0535709Z     		"sarif"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0536066Z     			Report results to stdout in SARIF format.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0536438Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0536764Z     		"github-check"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0537193Z     			Report results to GitHub Check. It works both for Pull Requests and commits.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0537733Z     			For Pull Request, you can see report results in GitHub PullRequest Check
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0538264Z     			tab and can control filtering mode by -filter-mode flag.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0538675Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0539002Z     			There are two options to use this reporter.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0539684Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0540078Z     			Option 1) Run reviewdog from GitHub Actions w/ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0540608Z     				Note that it reports result to GitHub Actions log console for Pull
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0541175Z     				Requests from fork repository due to GitHub Actions restriction.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0541817Z     				https://help.github.com/en/articles/virtual-environments-for-github-actions#github_token-secret
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0542341Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0542712Z     				Set REVIEWDOG_GITHUB_API_TOKEN with secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN. e.g.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0543220Z     						REVIEWDOG_GITHUB_API_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0543618Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0543930Z     			Option 2) Install reviewdog GitHub Apps
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0544406Z     				1. Install reviewdog Apps. https://github.com/apps/reviewdog
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0544870Z     				2. Set REVIEWDOG_TOKEN.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0545433Z     				You can get token from https://reviewdog.app/gh/<owner>/<repo-name>.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0545901Z     				$ export REVIEWDOG_TOKEN="xxxxx"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0546224Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0546545Z     		"github-pr-check"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0546956Z     			Same as github-check reporter but it only supports Pull Requests.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0547456Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0547784Z     		"github-pr-review"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0548147Z     			Report results to GitHub review comments.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0548551Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0548903Z     			1. Set REVIEWDOG_GITHUB_API_TOKEN environment variable.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0549714Z     			Go to https://github.com/settings/tokens and create new Personal access token with repo scope.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0550233Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0550533Z     			For GitHub Enterprise:
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0551009Z     				$ export GITHUB_API="https://example.githubenterprise.com/api/v3"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0551428Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0551718Z     		"github-annotations"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0552183Z     			Report results to stdout in GitHub Actions annotation format.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0552609Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0552924Z     		"github-pr-annotations"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0553380Z     			Same as github-annotations reporter but it only supports Pull Requests.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0553819Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0554145Z     		"gitlab-mr-discussion"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0554537Z     			Report results to GitLab MergeRequest discussion.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0554901Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0555269Z     			1. Set REVIEWDOG_GITLAB_API_TOKEN environment variable.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0555765Z     			Go to https://gitlab.com/profile/personal_access_tokens
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0556186Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0556702Z     			CI_API_V4_URL (defined by Gitlab CI) as the base URL for the Gitlab API automatically.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0557336Z     			Alternatively, GITLAB_API can also be defined, and it will take precedence over the former:
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0557911Z     				$ export GITLAB_API="https://example.gitlab.com/api/v4"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0558317Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0558626Z     		"gitlab-mr-commit"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0559065Z     			Same as gitlab-mr-discussion, but report results to GitLab comments for
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0559736Z     			each commits in Merge Requests.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0560115Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0560471Z     		"gerrit-change-review"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0560855Z     			Report results to Gerrit Change comments.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0561205Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0561600Z     			1. Set GERRIT_USERNAME and GERRIT_PASSWORD for basic authentication or
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0562127Z     			GIT_GITCOOKIE_PATH for git cookie based authentication.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0562676Z     			2. Set GERRIT_CHANGE_ID, GERRIT_REVISION_ID GERRIT_BRANCH and GERRIT_ADDRESS
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0563107Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0563399Z     			For example:
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0563868Z     				$ export GERRIT_CHANGE_ID=myproject~master~I1293efab014de2
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0564418Z     				$ export GERRIT_REVISION_ID=ed318bf9a3c
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0564830Z     				$ export GERRIT_BRANCH=master
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0565265Z     				$ export GERRIT_ADDRESS=http://localhost:8080
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0565642Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0565965Z     		"bitbucket-code-report"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0566388Z     			Create Bitbucket Code Report via Code Insights
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0566913Z     			(https://confluence.atlassian.com/display/BITBUCKET/Code+insights).
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0567387Z     			You can set custom report name with:
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0567743Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0568180Z     			If running as part of Bitbucket Pipelines no additional configurations is needed.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0568790Z     			If running outside of Bitbucket Pipelines you need to provide git repo data
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0569531Z     			(see documentation below for local reporters) and BitBucket credentials:
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0570111Z     			- For Basic Auth you need to set following env variables:
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0570557Z     				  BITBUCKET_USER and BITBUCKET_PASSWORD
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0571017Z     			- For AccessToken Auth you need to set BITBUCKET_ACCESS_TOKEN
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0571419Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0571824Z     			To post results to Bitbucket Server specify BITBUCKET_SERVER_URL.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0572291Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0572620Z     		"gitea-pr-review"
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0572980Z     			Report results to Gitea review comments.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0573325Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0573740Z     			1. Set REVIEWDOG_GITEA_API_TOKEN environment variable.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0574352Z     			Go to https://<gitea-server>/user/settings/applications and create new Access Token token with repo scope.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0575058Z     			2. Set GITEA_ADDRESS environment variable to your Gitea server base address.
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0575501Z     			For example:
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0575887Z     				$ export GITEA_ADDRESS=http://localhost:3000
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0576253Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0576622Z     		For GitHub Enterprise and self hosted GitLab or Gitea, set
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0577199Z     		REVIEWDOG_INSECURE_SKIP_VERIFY to skip verifying SSL (please use this at your own risk)
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0577752Z     			$ export REVIEWDOG_INSECURE_SKIP_VERIFY=true
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0578136Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0578557Z     		For non-local reporters, reviewdog automatically get necessary data from
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0579499Z     		environment variable in CI service (GitHub Actions, Travis CI, Circle CI, drone.io, GitLab CI, Bitbucket Pipelines).
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0580366Z     		You can set necessary data with following environment variable manually if
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0580836Z     		you want (e.g. run reviewdog in Jenkins).
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0581466Z     	
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0581866Z     			$ export CI_PULL_REQUEST=14 # Pull Request number (e.g. 14)
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0582398Z     			$ export CI_COMMIT="$(git rev-parse @)" # SHA1 for the current build
static / reviewdog (diff-only)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-26T11:37:49.0582889Z     			$ export CI_REPO_OWNER="haya14busa" # repository owner
